While we're on this topic,

00:59:40.850 --> 00:59:44.430
there's two brief statements
or questions in the chat

00:59:44.430 --> 00:59:48.130
from Larry Hashman and
Jared Bakeman or Bikeman,

00:59:48.130 --> 00:59:49.210
I'm not sure how to pronounce it,

00:59:49.210 --> 00:59:51.960
but can you read those yourself

00:59:51.960 --> 00:59:54.554
or would you like them to read it or?

00:59:54.554 --> 00:59:56.073
