01:00:00.670 --> 01:00:02.430
- Larry is asking about

01:00:02.430 --> 01:00:05.610
whether the men were
surprised I was a woman

01:00:05.610 --> 01:00:07.373
and interested in their drinking.

01:00:09.580 --> 01:00:12.540
There were alcohol drinking
women in the village.

01:00:12.540 --> 01:00:15.419
A couple of uncle Mobi's wife

01:00:15.419 --> 01:00:17.990
was kind of a lapsing Christian.

01:00:17.990 --> 01:00:20.940
And uncle Yosa's wife was not a Christian

01:00:20.940 --> 01:00:24.010
until uncle Yosa eventually
converted to Christianity,

01:00:24.010 --> 01:00:26.140
and then she followed him.

01:00:26.140 --> 01:00:30.293
So women drinkers are not unheard of.

01:00:32.630 --> 01:00:36.230
I felt that they were
not so much surprised.

01:00:36.230 --> 01:00:39.212
And I think I wasn't actually,
it was kind of organic.

01:00:39.212 --> 01:00:41.290
I didn't really start
it off very interested.

01:00:41.290 --> 01:00:42.630
I think I started off very annoyed

01:00:42.630 --> 01:00:44.196
because I was like, "Oh,
why do I have to stay up

01:00:44.196 --> 01:00:46.870
"and listen to you drinking?"

01:00:46.870 --> 01:00:49.150
But then I think it took some time

01:00:49.150 --> 01:00:51.613
for me to to listen with auntie Yona.

01:00:52.660 --> 01:00:55.433
She's always so generous and patient.

01:00:56.440 --> 01:01:00.160
And then I think it was
very much a spectacle.

01:01:00.160 --> 01:01:02.797
So it was very much kind
of, "I want you to see this.

01:01:02.797 --> 01:01:04.330
"I want you to take pictures of me."

01:01:04.330 --> 01:01:07.500
And even got a bit angry

01:01:07.500 --> 01:01:09.180
when sometimes I was so tired.

01:01:09.180 --> 01:01:11.180
I didn't wanna take pictures anymore.

01:01:11.180 --> 01:01:14.603
And so I think maybe not so much.

01:01:18.150 --> 01:01:21.100
Yeah. Maybe I think they
were not so much surprised

01:01:21.100 --> 01:01:23.250
as wanting to be heard.

01:01:23.250 --> 01:01:24.790
I think it was surprising for them

01:01:24.790 --> 01:01:27.030
that I wanted to learn Lisu language

01:01:27.030 --> 01:01:28.590
because it's always considered...

01:01:28.590 --> 01:01:32.330
I mean, why would you study
Lisu, it's so useless,

01:01:32.330 --> 01:01:37.230
by the Chinese government's
kind of propaganda,

01:01:37.230 --> 01:01:39.800
but actually many of these
non-Christian Lisu men

01:01:39.800 --> 01:01:42.650
were not as surprised as the Christians

01:01:42.650 --> 01:01:44.150
about why I wanted to learn Lisu.

01:01:44.150 --> 01:01:45.957
For them it was, "We have a lot of skills.

01:01:45.957 --> 01:01:47.067
"We have a lot of knowledge.

01:01:47.067 --> 01:01:48.527
"Why wouldn't you want to learn from us?

01:01:48.527 --> 01:01:51.500
"It's so strange that my kids
don't want to learn from me."

01:01:51.500 --> 01:01:55.950
And so I think maybe they are surprised

01:01:55.950 --> 01:01:57.680
that younger generation people

01:01:57.680 --> 01:01:59.433
are not taking them more seriously.

01:02:00.440 --> 01:02:01.940
Does that answer the question?

