01:02:35.090 --> 01:02:36.640
My fault here, I didn't notice.

01:02:38.830 --> 01:02:41.593
Yeah. The meat prohibition
is really interesting.

01:02:47.997 --> 01:02:50.830
Ethnographically, the idea is that

01:02:50.830 --> 01:02:52.410
Christians are not allowed

01:02:52.410 --> 01:02:54.620
to eat the meat of non-Christians

01:02:54.620 --> 01:02:56.148
because it will make them sick,

01:02:56.148 --> 01:02:59.200
that it's kind of a betrayal of a promise

01:02:59.200 --> 01:03:03.250
that you made to God and
that you will be punished.

01:03:03.250 --> 01:03:06.390
And there were stories about men who...

01:03:07.540 --> 01:03:10.573
The ones that I'm thinking of all men.

01:03:12.930 --> 01:03:16.110
The alcohol drinking men who
converted to Christianity,

01:03:16.110 --> 01:03:19.070
but then ate the meat

01:03:21.090 --> 01:03:22.390
of a non-Christian

01:03:23.630 --> 01:03:27.960
died of some tummy problem,

01:03:27.960 --> 01:03:31.960
he couldn't stop going to the bathroom.

01:03:31.960 --> 01:03:36.050
And another one wasn't to
do with Christianity so much

01:03:36.050 --> 01:03:36.893
and non Christianity.

01:03:36.893 --> 01:03:40.650
There was a Christian who ate the meat

01:03:42.574 --> 01:03:43.863
of a wild animal.

01:03:45.090 --> 01:03:47.570
And actually it might not
even to do with the...

01:03:47.570 --> 01:03:50.100
I'm not so sure if the
person was Christian,

01:03:50.100 --> 01:03:54.430
but the Lisu person ate
the meat of a wild animal,

01:03:54.430 --> 01:03:55.970
a big wild animal.

01:03:55.970 --> 01:03:59.900
and wild animals are supposed
to have spirits in them

01:03:59.900 --> 01:04:03.100
and that spirit eventually
killed Lisu person.

01:04:03.100 --> 01:04:05.260
So there are the stories about meat

01:04:05.260 --> 01:04:08.450
that can be eaten and cannot be eaten

01:04:10.120 --> 01:04:11.530
along the lines of Christian

01:04:11.530 --> 01:04:15.063
and along the lines of Lisu
verses the spirits as well.

01:04:17.150 --> 01:04:20.260
I think it's something to do...

01:04:20.260 --> 01:04:21.556
My instinct is to think

01:04:21.556 --> 01:04:23.923
that it's something to
do with reciprocity.

01:04:25.866 --> 01:04:26.850
because one of the stories

01:04:26.850 --> 01:04:30.950
is that Lisu actually have
an agreement with the spirits

01:04:31.980 --> 01:04:35.020
to always be giving meat to the spirits.

01:04:35.020 --> 01:04:40.020
If the Lisu stops providing
meat to the spirits,

01:04:40.470 --> 01:04:43.610
then the Lisu person will fall ill.

01:04:43.610 --> 01:04:45.221
But it's been many, many years

01:04:45.221 --> 01:04:49.520
since Christians provide
meat to the spirits.

01:04:49.520 --> 01:04:53.620
And so perhaps it's something
about allegiances and betrayal

01:04:58.548 --> 01:05:03.020
and the punishments for not
meeting those reciprocal ties.

01:05:04.404 --> 01:05:06.500
I'm sorry. Does that answer a little bit?

01:05:06.500 --> 01:05:08.169
I think this is something
that I'm also working on

01:05:08.169 --> 01:05:10.883
and trying to make sense of too.

