01:06:09.440 --> 01:06:12.910
when I first came there from Ho Chi Minh City.

01:06:12.910 --> 01:06:14.990
And so (mumbles) the men drinking

01:06:14.990 --> 01:06:17.530
and is exactly the same.

01:06:17.530 --> 01:06:19.990
So my question is, I have a
lot of question in my head,

01:06:19.990 --> 01:06:20.823
but we don't have time.

01:06:20.823 --> 01:06:23.656
I just have one question for now.

01:06:23.656 --> 01:06:26.187
The women's attitudes,

01:06:26.187 --> 01:06:30.297
based on my observation
in the Mekong Delta

01:06:30.297 --> 01:06:34.283
20 years ago when the
economic development,

01:06:35.420 --> 01:06:37.400
women didn't go outside,

01:06:37.400 --> 01:06:38.960
they stay in the village

01:06:40.350 --> 01:06:45.350
and then they enjoy the men's drinking.

01:06:45.370 --> 01:06:47.470
Sometimes they complain, but they enjoy.

01:06:47.470 --> 01:06:50.830
So through drinking men empower
themselves through drinking

01:06:50.830 --> 01:06:53.680
and women enjoyed it and
women prepared for them,

01:06:53.680 --> 01:06:57.340
but I will encourage them to drinking.

01:06:57.340 --> 01:06:59.430
They don't complain, they didn't complain.

01:06:59.430 --> 01:07:02.120
But when economically developed,

01:07:02.120 --> 01:07:06.580
women went outside for chop income,

01:07:06.580 --> 01:07:09.060
they didn't like it anymore.

01:07:09.930 --> 01:07:13.280
I'm not sure, that's about
Vietnam, the Mekong Delta.

01:07:13.280 --> 01:07:15.800
So I'm not sure what happened there

01:07:15.800 --> 01:07:19.641
based in the area where you research.

01:07:19.641 --> 01:07:23.490
because you talk about
development in this course

01:07:24.630 --> 01:07:28.380
and how that influenced
the women's attitude

01:07:28.380 --> 01:07:29.530
and the men's...

01:07:29.530 --> 01:07:31.680
Men stayed the same, I
think, in the Mekong Delta,

01:07:31.680 --> 01:07:33.020
men still enjoy drinking,

01:07:33.020 --> 01:07:36.490
but women they can't
because of development.

01:07:36.490 --> 01:07:37.530
That's my question.

01:07:37.530 --> 01:07:38.530
I have a lot, but...

01:07:42.020 --> 01:07:43.290
- [Ting] Yeah. Thank you.

01:07:43.290 --> 01:07:44.960
That's so interesting.

01:07:44.960 --> 01:07:46.360
That's so interesting.

01:07:46.360 --> 01:07:47.910
So after development,

01:07:47.910 --> 01:07:50.773
they actually stopped
enjoying the men drinking.

01:07:51.684 --> 01:07:54.353
It's so interesting. (laughs)

01:07:57.927 --> 01:08:00.023
I think where I'm working,

01:08:03.420 --> 01:08:06.203
the women in general
if they are Christians,

01:08:07.440 --> 01:08:10.490
they generally really perform,

01:08:10.490 --> 01:08:12.829
not liking men drinking

01:08:12.829 --> 01:08:17.829
but backstage they do drink
kind of like a special occasions

01:08:19.560 --> 01:08:22.350
and they have like a special alcohol beer

01:08:22.350 --> 01:08:24.327
and then they will, "Okay, secret. Secret.

01:08:24.327 --> 01:08:25.603
"Don't tell anybody."

01:08:25.603 --> 01:08:28.140
And I take pleasure in that

01:08:28.140 --> 01:08:30.603
'cause I actually want
to drink a lot of times,

01:08:32.541 --> 01:08:34.620
and so I don't tell people

01:08:34.620 --> 01:08:36.620
because I want to continue drinking too.

01:08:39.084 --> 01:08:41.470
So, then I think there
was also this incident

01:08:41.470 --> 01:08:42.480
that was very interesting

01:08:42.480 --> 01:08:44.760
'cause I think, I feel like
auntie Yona was kind of that way

01:08:44.760 --> 01:08:48.620
where she really enjoyed
hanging out with men drinking.

01:08:48.620 --> 01:08:51.590
And actually there was a period of time.

01:08:51.590 --> 01:08:54.423
And so her daughter and
a lot of other women too,

01:08:55.930 --> 01:08:57.670
outwardly, they really perform

01:08:57.670 --> 01:08:59.470
how they don't let alcohol drinking men,

01:08:59.470 --> 01:09:00.730
but then when it comes to hanging out

01:09:00.730 --> 01:09:01.750
with alcohol drinking men,

01:09:01.750 --> 01:09:02.650
some of them really seem

01:09:02.650 --> 01:09:05.280
to be having a lot of fun with the men.

01:09:05.280 --> 01:09:10.110
And in fact, when uncle Zoda
stopped drinking for a while,

01:09:10.110 --> 01:09:15.110
because he was very shocked
by uncle Mobi's death

01:09:15.860 --> 01:09:17.360
and really worried about himself

01:09:17.360 --> 01:09:18.940
because the villages often say

01:09:18.940 --> 01:09:21.660
that death in the village
I work with come in pairs.

01:09:21.660 --> 01:09:23.460
So he was really worried about his life,

01:09:23.460 --> 01:09:25.540
and he stopped drinking for a while.

01:09:25.540 --> 01:09:29.120
And it was almost as if auntie
Yona was very disappointed.

01:09:29.120 --> 01:09:31.000
Auntie Yona and Nana
seemed almost disappointed

01:09:31.000 --> 01:09:33.123
that he was no longer drinking.

01:09:34.400 --> 01:09:36.623
There's that, I think maybe it's similar,

01:09:37.640 --> 01:09:38.844
but I haven't really come across

01:09:38.844 --> 01:09:42.250
how women coming back and
they don't like men drinking,

01:09:42.250 --> 01:09:44.178
but I feel like a lot
of time women come back

01:09:44.178 --> 01:09:47.103
and, in fact, they drink themselves.

01:09:48.158 --> 01:09:51.573
So kind of the migration patterns change.

01:09:53.523 --> 01:09:54.880
A lot of people become not Christian

01:09:54.880 --> 01:09:57.880
after they come back from
migrating in the cities.

01:09:59.398 --> 01:10:00.763
Yeah, so interesting.

01:10:00.763 --> 01:10:02.300
(laughs) The change of...

