You have to go down to the village brigade

01:10:58.810 --> 01:10:59.970
and if you can't write,

01:10:59.970 --> 01:11:02.120
you have to find somebody who can write

01:11:02.120 --> 01:11:03.783
who can communicate, who can....

01:11:11.600 --> 01:11:13.530
Going to fights, and she
had to deal with that.

01:11:13.530 --> 01:11:17.750
So uncle was often yeah, just drinking

01:11:19.861 --> 01:11:22.410
and she would have to deal with all that.

01:11:22.410 --> 01:11:25.570
And so it's very gendered
and very patriarchal.

01:11:25.570 --> 01:11:26.900
And when he was drunk he often

01:11:26.900 --> 01:11:29.403
would even try to stop her from relaxing.

01:11:31.654 --> 01:11:34.580
Yeah, I think that's
something, I think it's...

01:11:37.100 --> 01:11:38.190
It is an affliction.

01:11:38.190 --> 01:11:42.550
It's not easy for anybody
to be in that space.

01:11:42.550 --> 01:11:44.870
I guess at the same time

01:11:44.870 --> 01:11:47.600
as trying not to romanticize drinking,

01:11:47.600 --> 01:11:51.640
I think it's also important
to hear this other angle,

01:11:51.640 --> 01:11:54.060
but I think it is from
the women's perspective

01:11:54.060 --> 01:11:56.900
it can be very frustrating.

01:11:56.900 --> 01:11:59.710
And from Christian women,
like Auntie Yona's perspective

01:11:59.710 --> 01:12:02.650
who has to deal with so much
of the mundane everyday life.

01:12:02.650 --> 01:12:04.380
And it's so interesting, it's so gender

01:12:04.380 --> 01:12:07.579
that the men tend to take the spectacle,

01:12:07.579 --> 01:12:10.490
whereas the women are in
the mundane and the boring.

01:12:10.490 --> 01:12:11.410
And I ended up writing

01:12:11.410 --> 01:12:13.610
about the spectacle
rather than the mundane.

01:12:14.450 --> 01:12:16.843
Yeah, it's very interesting.
Thank you, Danny.

01:12:18.510 --> 01:12:21.470
- [Eric] Well, thank you
Ting for a fantastic talk.

01:12:21.470 --> 01:12:24.020
I hope everyone can
join me in thanking you

01:12:24.020 --> 01:12:25.950
for just this wonderful presentation,

01:12:25.950 --> 01:12:28.380
and great Q and A session
as well. (clapping)

01:12:28.380 --> 01:12:29.740
- [Ting] Thank you for the chance

01:12:29.740 --> 01:12:31.310
and thank you for the great questions.

01:12:31.310 --> 01:12:33.128
So helpful for me.

01:12:33.128 --> 01:12:34.653
Really helpful.

